# Build-context exclusions.
#
# Leading slashes are deliberate: a bare `data` or `models` pattern risks
# matching src/retail_intel/data, which would ship an image missing the
# ingest and feature modules entirely. The same unanchored pattern in
# .gitignore did exactly that.
.git
.github
.venv
venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
htmlcov
.coverage
coverage.xml
tests
notebooks
/data
/mlruns
/mlflow.db
/reports
*.db
.env
